<title>USA: Port St Lucie, Fla., yields 5.50 pct in 2016.</title>
<headline>Port St Lucie, Fla., yields 5.50 pct in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanifen, Imhoff Inc said it priced $17.950 million of Port St Lucie, Fla., special assessment bonds, Series 1997A with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2016.</p>
